# =========================
# Misc / safety
# =========================
# Never commit lockfiles? For pnpm, you usually DO commit pnpm-lock.yaml.
# If you ever want to ignore it locally (not recommended for a public lib), uncomment:
# pnpm-lock.yaml

# Prevent accidental commits of common secret patterns
*.envrc
.envrc
.secrets
secrets/
credentials/